#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:78 97f0c97e4a9c4f038e92aea1c24314ab
msgid ""
"`mdc_gid_to_stereo` returns the stereo type of the wire, which can be `0`"
" (axial), `-1` for `west_phi < east_phi` and `1` for `west_phi > "
"east_phi`."
msgstr ""
"`mdc_gid_to_stereo` 返回丝的 stereo 类型：`0` 表示 axial，`-1` 表示 `west_phi < "
"east_phi`，`1` 表示 `west_phi > east_phi`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:81 589db4a54f234e0fa0dc26e51bb1e56e
msgid "Use `parse_mdc_gid` to parse all fields from a gid at once:"
msgstr "用 `parse_mdc_gid` 一次性解析 gid 的所有字段："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:110 bc3a975a3eb344678c113a2883fe5459
msgid ""
"When the input is an `ak.Array`, the result is also an `ak.Array` with "
"record fields."
msgstr "当输入为 `ak.Array` 时，结果也是带 record 字段的 `ak.Array`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:112 787803e4d1724dd88583001b7211c294
msgid "Wire position"
msgstr "丝的位置"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:114 618b99878dca4124bd75fe83ef3ce567
msgid ""
"All `mdc_gid_to_west_*`, `mdc_gid_to_east_*`, `mdc_gid_z_to_*` are also "
"backed by compiled NumPy ufuncs."
msgstr ""
"`mdc_gid_to_west_*`、`mdc_gid_to_east_*` 与 `mdc_gid_z_to_*` 同样由编译好的 NumPy "
"ufunc 实现。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:175 ad2fe258bc6640da803f089548a8d132
msgid ""
"Get the x, y coordinates of a wire at a specific z position. "
"`mdc_gid_z_to_x` / `mdc_gid_z_to_y` take two arguments (`gid` and `z`), "
"both support scalar/array inputs independently:"
msgstr ""
"获取某条丝在给定 z 处的 x、y 坐标。`mdc_gid_z_to_x` / `mdc_gid_z_to_y` 接受两个参数（`gid` 与 "
"`z`），两者都独立支持标量/数组输入："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:232 38dce9e8e7544f419fabbdd2230e59a9
msgid "Retrieve the full wire position table:"
msgstr "获取完整的丝位置表："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:245 98e69293c4964845ac1e4284fef74f8d
msgid "Raw data conversion"
msgstr "原始数据转换"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:247 0282e9f0ba31420d993d469ebf4abffb
msgid ""
"The ADC and the TDC channel numbers of a hit can be converted into charge"
" and time with `mdc_adc_to_charge` and `mdc_tdc_to_time`:"
msgstr "hit 的 ADC 与 TDC 道数可用 `mdc_adc_to_charge` 与 `mdc_tdc_to_time` 分别转换为电荷与时间："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:260 8c5527c0455d4a148a2f39039f67182f
msgid "The conversion formula of the time is:"
msgstr "时间的换算公式为："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:262 9bd0fc1cc67e4cb581e68dfa4f0a1cf1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times 0.09375~\\mathrm{ns}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times 0.09375~\\mathrm{ns}\n"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:267 6f646e6ef53e4025971ede67a0655690
msgid ""
"In BOSS there is no concrete physics unit of the MDC charge: the raw "
"channel number is used in the reconstruction, hence `mdc_adc_to_charge` "
"only casts the ADC to `float64`."
msgstr ""
"BOSS 中 MDC 的电荷没有具体的物理单位：重建时直接使用原始道数，因此 `mdc_adc_to_charge` 只是把 ADC 转成 "
"`float64`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:270 ae1cfb00cb554c83b1ca2f9dde6fe802
msgid "Same as BOSS"
msgstr "与 BOSS 一致"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:273 10f5807e046a44beadd48cf6513788a4
msgid ""
"MDC charge and time calculations are the same as the ones given by "
"`RawDataUtil::MdcCharge` and `RawDataUtil::MdcTime` in BOSS."
msgstr ""
"MDC 的电荷与时间计算与 BOSS 中 `RawDataUtil::MdcCharge` 和 `RawDataUtil::MdcTime` "
"给出的结果一致。"

